m being executed.\n\nThe `htmlStriped` function is likely to remove or escape any HTML tags in the input, thus preventing any scripts from being executed. This change is directly related to the vulnerability and is intended to fix it.\n\nTherefore, the function `selectRelativeTime` is vulnerable and has been changed to fix the vulnerability.\n\n```json\n{\n\"answer\": 1\n}\n```"}
